Have you ever had a really big secret?

2
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Big is a fantasy, drama, comedy film directed by Penny Marshall.

3
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
When a young boy makes a wish at a carnival machine to be big—he wakes up the following
morning to find that it has been granted and his body has grown older overnight.

4
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
But he is still the same 13-year-old boy inside.

5
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
Now he must learn how to cope with the unfamiliar world of grown-ups including
getting a job and having his first romantic encounter with a woman.

6
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:18,000
Josh Baskin, played by Tom Hanks.

7
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
Susan, played by Elizabeth Perkins.

8
